<title>SWITZERLAND: Sulzer says job cut provisions to hurt net.</title>
<headline>Sulzer says job cut provisions to hurt net.</headline>
<dateline>RUETI, Switzerland 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sulzer Rueti group president Helmut Pirchl said provisions for major job cuts through 1997 will be taken mainly in 1996 and will lower Sulzer group net profit.</p>
<p>&quot;The group net profit will be worsened correspondingly,&quot; Pirchl told a news conference.</p>
</text>
